{"articleNo":"506544","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=506544&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학원] 2025 K-GKS Admission Call for Graduate School Studying at KIT, Korea","writer":"국제교류교육원","writeDate":"2025.02.17","hit":"11982","attachments":[{"name":"★2025 K-GKS Application Forms.docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=506544&attachNo=141099"},{"name":"★2025~1.PDF","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=506544&attachNo=141100"},{"name":"★2025~2.PDF","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=506544&attachNo=141101"},{"name":"★2025_K-GKS_Available_Field_of_Study_KIT.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=506544&attachNo=141198"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><a name=\"_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">2025&nbsp;</span></b></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#0900FF\">K-GKS Admission Call</span></b></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">&nbsp;for Graduate School Studying\nat KIT, Korea</span></b></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">We are pleased to inform you of\n2025&nbsp;<b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\">K-GKS (K-Global Korea\nScholarship)</b> Guidelines for Master’s and Doctoral candidates here in Korea.</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">As the one and only national\nengineering specialized university in Korea, we will be able to nominate\ncandidates up to 10 for this K-GKS admission. This might be a great opportunity\nfor you to be able to study in Korea with a full regional government\nscholarship and to settle down with decent jobs supported by Gyeongsangbuk-do\nand KIT.</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">Please see attached for further\ninformation and if there are any candidates interested in this program, please\nsend me&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:red\">one\noriginal application document package by post no later than April 18th, (Friday),\n2025</span></b></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">. Your\noriginal application documents must be delivered to my office by the deadline.</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">1.&nbsp;Scholarship\nDuration<o:p></o:p></span></b></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-overlap:never;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184\">\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:8.25pt\">\n  <td width=\"124\" style=\"width:93.15pt;border-top:solid black 2.25pt;border-left:\n  none;border-bottom:double black 2.25pt;border-right:solid black 1.0pt;\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid black 2.25p